id: xpi-confirm
section: Personas and add-ons
item: Install an extension by finger: the page's InstallTrigger button raises the card's install prompt, OK by tap installs it (the page's callback reads status 0) and about:addons lists it
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-xpi-trigger.html
kit: cavekit-addons-extensions.md R3
fixture: xpi
wait rect effect 20
calibrate 'sel:p'
tap effect
expect dialog present 10
shoot xpi-prompt
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait text r 'callback status=0' 30
launch about:addons 40
wait rect 'sel:#category-extension' 40
tap 'sel:#category-extension'
wait rect 'sel:#category-extension[selected="true"]' 8
shoot extensions-pane
wait rect 'sel:richlistitem[value="jihad-effect@riverstonerelay.net"]' 30
